WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
you are really hungry

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,290
no see for a few days

3
00:00:04,290 --> 00:00:06,290
My appetite has increased again, right?

4
00:00:06,290 --> 00:00:07,290
Didn’t I just say that?

5
00:00:07,290 --> 00:00:09,290
Do you think I'm kidding?

6
00:00:09,290 --> 00:00:11,060
You said you were waiting for your teammates

7
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:12,060
Just wait for him

8
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:13,060
He is very strong

9
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:14,060
Don't you know?

10
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:15,060
And based on my long-term observation

11
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:16,060
Classmate Jian is a very upright person

12
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:17,060
I won't take advantage of you

13
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:18,060
It’s not a question of integrity

14
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:20,060
His father is the highest provincial commander in the federation.

15
00:00:20,060 --> 00:00:24,320
What are you two talking about?

16
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:25,320
I'm praising you

17
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:32,420
I'll buy you anything you want to eat

18
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:33,420
We have already eaten

19
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:38,940
How long has it been since you two have eaten?

20
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:41,000
Just one week

21
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Why do you look like a starving ghost reincarnated?

22
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Is it childish?

23
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,000
What new training program?

24
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Jian Jingyu

25
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Are you interested in participating in technical competitions?
